== How to opt in ==

Add <code>class=lead-wide</code> to the File link:

 <nowiki>[[File:Kicksecure-Desktop.png|thumb|class=lead-wide|A full-width captioned lead image.]]</nowiki>

The figure is no longer floated; it becomes a block as wide as the prose, captioned below. The page title still comes first in both the markup and on screen.

== Body text ==

Because the image is full width rather than floated, the body text begins below it. This treatment suits a wide screenshot that deserves the whole column and would look cramped squeezed into a float.

